	"Description": "Links this Unreal Editor to bitGen Studio on the same computer: bitGen lists the project's levels, sequences, cameras, MetaHumans and animations, takes stills from a camera and renders sequences with the Movie Render Queue for its image editor and timeline. Python only (Content/Python) - no build needed.",
